## How to add my project in showcase

@steps
@step title="Make a fork of the repository."
@end
@step title="Add the image(s) under `docs/src/assets/showcase-images` folder."
@end
@step title="Make a copy of the `_template.md` file under"
`docs/src/content/docs/community/showcase` folder.
@end
@step title="Rename the copied file to the name of your project. (Name should not start"
with `_`))
@end
@step title="Update the title, image, link and content of the file."
@end
@step title="Add it on the above list in"
`docs/src/content/docs/community/showcase/index.mdx`.
@end
@step title="Submit a PR."

@end
@end
